with your Claw of Destruction.

244
00:14:37,440 --> 00:14:41,860
The difference in their attack strengths
means you lose 1,000 life points.

245
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:46,200
Now, Merrick, you have no
monsters left to protect you.

246
00:14:46,740 --> 00:14:48,300
Very impressive dueling.

247
00:14:48,480 --> 00:14:51,477
But I'm just testing out your
strengths and weaknesses so that

248
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:55,325
I can ultimately destroy you and
take away all that you possess.

249
00:14:55,920 --> 00:15:00,120
It's time for round two, and this
duel is about to get interesting.

250
00:15:00,980 --> 00:15:01,900
Are you ready?

251
00:15:03,760 --> 00:15:07,097
The card I now hold is like
nothing you've ever seen before.

252
00:15:07,180 --> 00:15:10,460
It is a creature that
simply cannot be destroyed.

253
00:15:11,000 --> 00:15:16,140
It's a shapeless being made completely
of plasma with no solid mass,

254
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:18,300
making it utterly indestructible.

255
00:15:18,460 --> 00:15:21,077
And the perfect defense
against enemy attack.

256
00:15:21,160 --> 00:15:25,500
So prepare to experience
Revival Jab in defense mode.

257
00:15:26,720 --> 00:15:28,200
Just try to attack.

258
00:15:28,420 --> 00:15:30,300
You will fail, I tell you.

259
00:15:30,800 --> 00:15:32,620
It looks weak to me, Merrick.

260
00:15:32,840 --> 00:15:34,177
It looks weak, does it?

261
00:15:34,260 --> 00:15:35,789
Well, take a look at this.

262
00:15:41,160 --> 00:15:43,620
It's my gem, Breeding Machine!

263
00:15:44,600 --> 00:15:47,580
And it begins the countdown
to your destruction!

264
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:52,340
What's it do?

265
00:15:52,580 --> 00:15:54,677
Think of it as a monster-creating machine,

266
00:15:54,760 --> 00:15:57,877
breathing life into a new
plasma creature every turn.

267
00:15:57,960 --> 00:16:00,817
And this machine will
continue to provide me with

268
00:16:00,900 --> 00:16:04,280
more and more plasma
beasts called Slime Tokens!

269
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,677
Your plan's obvious.

270
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:08,677
You're going to produce
plasma monsters until you have

271
00:16:08,760 --> 00:16:12,160
enough to sacrifice and
summon your Egyptian god card.

272
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,960
Very impressive, Pharaoh.

273
00:16:14,480 --> 00:16:16,009
Too bad you can't stop me.

274
00:16:16,260 --> 00:16:19,420
Once my breeding machine
creates three slime tokens,

275
00:16:19,700 --> 00:16:23,777
I'll be able to summon the monster that
will bring about your ultimate destruction,

276
00:16:23,860 --> 00:16:26,037
my Egyptian god card.

277
00:16:26,120 --> 00:16:29,532
And then your Millennium Puzzle
will belong to me forever.

278
00:16:31,280 --> 00:16:34,397
Sorry, Merrick, but as long as I
believe in the heart of the cards,

279
00:16:34,480 --> 00:16:36,020
Your plan will never work,

280
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:38,140
so prepare to lose!

281
00:16:40,140 --> 00:16:41,600
My Buster Blader!

282
00:16:41,900 --> 00:16:43,737
Now's the perfect time to summon him!

283
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:45,757
I need to wipe out
Merrick's life points before

284
00:16:45,840 --> 00:16:48,357
his breeding machine
creates three more monsters!

285
00:16:48,440 --> 00:16:53,600
And now I'll sacrifice my two monsters
on the field to summon this creature!

286
00:16:53,980 --> 00:16:56,900
My all-powerful Buster Blader!

287
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:02,857
My expert swordsman has
the power to wipe out your

288
00:17:02,940 --> 00:17:05,980
revival gem and more than
half of your life points.

289
00:17:06,760 --> 00:17:10,360
Your monster's attack strength
is quite impressive, Pharaoh,

290
00:17:10,640 --> 00:17:13,540
but it's still useless
against my revival gem.

291
00:17:13,960 --> 00:17:14,980
We'll see.

292
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:19,240
Now, my sword-wielding monster,
destroy his revival gem!

293
00:17:20,680 --> 00:17:22,760
Your monster's been splattered.

294
00:17:24,220 --> 00:17:25,500
As it's...

295
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,640
What's happening?

296
00:17:33,400 --> 00:17:34,920
It's reforming!

297
00:17:38,540 --> 00:17:39,840
You're surprised?

298
00:17:40,240 --> 00:17:43,520
I told you my Revival Gem
employed the perfect defense.

299
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:47,820
Even the most powerful sword
cannot destroy my plasma monster.

300
00:17:48,100 --> 00:17:50,240
It will always reform itself.

301
00:17:50,600 --> 00:17:51,860
So I can't attack?

302
00:17:52,140 --> 00:17:53,317
You can't.

303
00:17:53,400 --> 00:17:54,518
It just won't work.

304
00:17:55,400 --> 00:17:58,280
So Revival Jam will
protect my life points,

305
00:17:58,420 --> 00:18:02,537
while my breeding machine continues to
create monsters for my ultimate sacrifice.

306
00:18:02,620 --> 00:18:06,091
But I need to find another way
to wipe out his life points.

307
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,050
And fast!

308
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:10,900
Your dueling days are almost over.

309
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:15,635
Soon my breeding machine will have
created enough monsters to sacrifice.

310
00:18:15,880 --> 00:18:17,762
Then comes your worst nightmare.

311
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:20,300
My Egyptian God card.

312
00:18:20,820 --> 00:18:21,920
Here's the first.

313
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:25,280
Activate my jam breeding machine.

314
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:29,280
There's slime token number one.

315
00:18:29,640 --> 00:18:32,100
I'll also set one card face down.

316
00:18:32,580 --> 00:18:34,320
Only two turns left.

317
00:18:34,540 --> 00:18:36,500
Then you'll meet your doom.

318
00:18:37,540 --> 00:18:39,600
Soon, that puzzle's mine.

319
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:42,137
I may not be able to stop
your breeding machine,

320
00:18:42,220 --> 00:18:44,749
but your plan has one
tragic flaw, Merrick.

321
00:18:44,840 --> 00:18:46,797
The rules state you
need to sacrifice three

322
00:18:46,880 --> 00:18:49,817
slime tokens to summon
your one Egyptian god card.

323
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:54,060
But what happens if I
destroy them first? You see,

324
00:18:54,220 --> 00:18:56,057
your slime tokens are defenseless against

325
00:18:56,140 --> 00:18:58,697
the superior attack power
of my Buster Blader.

326
00:18:58,780 --> 00:19:00,657
I can take them out with no resistance.

327
00:19:00,740 --> 00:19:02,000
And more importantly,

328
00:19:02,300 --> 00:19:05,497
each time Buster Blader destroys
one of your slime tokens,

329
00:19:05,580 --> 00:19:09,168
you'll lose over 2,000 life
points because they're so feeble.

330
00:19:09,460 --> 00:19:13,420
So according to my calculations,
in two turns you'll be defeated.

331
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:17,000
Now, Buster Blader,
attack his slime token!

332
00:19:17,300 --> 00:19:18,337
Or don't.

333
00:19:18,420 --> 00:19:23,960
Reveal Facedown card, the
Continuous Trap card, Jam Defender!

334
00:19:32,920 --> 00:19:34,220
That can't be!

335
00:19:34,540 --> 00:19:37,580
Revival Jam shielded
your monster! Exactly!

336
00:19:37,840 --> 00:19:40,697
And as long as Revival
Jam stays in defense mode,

337
00:19:40,780 --> 00:19:44,057
the Jam Defender card forces it
to absorb all of your attacks!

338
00:19:44,140 --> 00:19:47,316
Which means every one of
your attacks will be blocked!

339
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:51,160
You see,

340
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:53,817
I knew you'd attack my
slime tokens in a desperate

341
00:19:53,900 --> 00:19:57,135
attempt to stop me from
summoning my Egyptian god card.

342
00:19:57,340 --> 00:20:00,222
So I protected them with
an indestructible force.

343
00:20:00,740 --> 00:20:02,160
The end is near.

344
00:20:02,440 --> 00:20:04,780
Now, another beast to sacrifice.

345
00:20:06,580 --> 00:20:08,800
Meet slime token number two.

346
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,940
I've got to stop this.

347
00:20:12,140 --> 00:20:15,180
I'm afraid there's only
one turn left, pharaoh.

348
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:20,820
Then I'll summon my Egyptian
God card to destroy you,

349
00:20:21,000 --> 00:20:26,100
but just to be safe, I think I'll play
this magic card, Nightmare Steel Cage,

350
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:29,637
to make sure you can't attack
me for the next two turns.

351
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:31,838
Not that you'll be around that long.

352
00:20:36,980 --> 00:20:40,057
Now all you can do is watch
while I summon the most

353
00:20:40,140 --> 00:20:43,100
powerful force you've ever
seen to annihilate you.

354
00:20:45,180 --> 00:20:50,020
Soon, the Millennium Puzzle and the
Pharaoh's power will be mine forever!
